# An allowlist: only what the image build needs goes into the build context,
# the Go code, go.mod and .env.sample (a test checks every setting is in it).
# Docs, scripts, a local .env or data/ and anything else at the root stay out.
#
# These lines are also the list of what changes the image: ci's gate reads
# them (scripts/dev-image.sh), docker.yml's push filter repeats them, and
# scripts/dev-image_test.sh fails when the two disagree. Keep the form the
# script reads: "*" first, then one "!<file or folder>" per line, no patterns.
*
!cmd
!internal
!go.mod
!.env.sample
